license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Killzone 2 // Unofficial PC Port (static recompilation). A native PC port of Killzone 2 (PS3) by static recompilation of its PPU and SPU code on ps3recomp, with the PS3
  system software it calls reimplemented and graphics on Direct3D 12. Contains no game code or data.
keywords:
  - static recompilation
  - PS3
  - ps3recomp
  - Killzone 2
  - game preservation
